[al:新概念英语（二）]
[ar:MP3 同步字幕版（英音）]
[ti:The Greenwood Boys]
[00:12.32]Why will the police have a difficult time?
[00:18.62]The Greenwood Boys are a group of pop singers.
[00:23.27]At present, they are visiting all parts of the country.
[00:28.59]They will be arriving here tomorrow.
[00:32.42]They will be coming by train and most of the young people in the town will be meeting them at the station.
[00:41.25]Tomorrow evening they will be singing at the Workers' Club.
[00:46.58]The Greenwood Boys will be staying for five days.
[00:50.96]During this time, they will give five performances.
[00:55.81]As usual, the police will have a difficult time.
